Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.06,0:01:35.03,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,760)}Off the Coast \Nof Laboratory 8
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:02:00.01,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(952,976)}{\fad(200,1500)}"Cruel Fate -\NKuma's Decision as a Father"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cruel fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's decision as a father.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.34,0:02:05.26,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Justice"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here on business, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awfully cold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing like Punk Hazard at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climate aside, this is where the future\Nof mankind itself will be created.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, dealing with the constant flow\Nof ideas is my biggest issue right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been too distracted to notice\Nsome of the finer points of this lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what the issue is.\NNot a word gets past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially not any secret\Ndeals with pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.50,0:02:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare stop Borsalino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't stand this side of you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not personal, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you this is business
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this Porcelino?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the lab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Vega? Punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know our priorities are\Ndifferent, but have some sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma is strong. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would make a fine base\Nfor your clone soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he is a pirate\Nwanted for $296 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man like that cannot serve\Nas a symbol of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of the Navy's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about saving face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the project succeeds, we'll be\Nsaving lives, far more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hardly ignore the\Npotential of such an endeavor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assuming that you can see it to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I have terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're listening, my first demand is\Nthat you join the seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a rookie named Ace took one of them down,\Nand we've been looking for a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirate world is in a state of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a man of your\Ncaliber to rein it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in addition to the clones, you yourself\Nmust become a human weapon for the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'd become a cyborg?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then as a warlord, you could triumph\Nagainst any pirate in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd make me safer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want that, don't you, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma, you also have history\Nwith the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, that is a clear\Nconflict of interest for the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to my third condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the process ends, your mind\Nand free will will be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is nothing but a\Nglorified death sentence!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this because the other\Nwarlords won't obey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cyborg without free will\Nis a soulless robot! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turn me into a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are in no position to argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a Navy scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the conditions for saving\Nthe life of a criminal's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we will not spend a fortune on\Nsurgeries to save some insignificant girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no running in the lab, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wrong. It's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Performing such an\Noperation would be inhumane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to do it, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was going to\Nmake impossible demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that I wouldn't\Nbe able to save my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have nothing more to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can help Bonney get well,\Nthen I'll happily accept any fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru, about the matter we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little brat, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk, how long until Kuma is modified\Nand his daughter's treatment is complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sapphire scale surgeries\Nwill take six months and then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll have to wait another\Nyear before she can go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's modifications\Nshould take two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means body will be better\Nbefore her 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter will be our hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once she recovers, you will\Nhave no reason to obey us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could take her and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't be too safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When her surgeries are complete,\Nwe'll take custody of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as your free will is gone,\Nthen she will be allowed to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kuma won't be able to\Nsee her after she gets well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll perform Kuma's surgeries while\Nhe serves as one of the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:08:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once his daughter is cured, he will\Nbe forbidden to contact her or escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that rule is violated, she'll\Nbe sent off to become a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have just one request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want her to know the truth about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her disease or the fact\Nthat she's a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after her surgeries don't make\Nher stay at some government facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Want you to let her\Nrest at the church in the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorbet kingdom where she grew up\NNothing more, but right. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never go there to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do exactly as you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where she's under watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These next two years will be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you were a good girl. Always!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, we're staying here for\Nthe next six months. We are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be here with me? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out you're not the\Nonly one who needs treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll get better together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, this weird guy is Saint Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she can be quite the handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine. I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is like a big maze\Nand it doesn't have any windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, were you running around on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just a chicken. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:09:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sneak off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have dreams to fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must chronicle these endless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ideas for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat for me, go to the bathroom for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seizes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a cat would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there were five more of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You busy? Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're bored, but I don't have\Ntime to hang out with you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of father are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter has no sense of modesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing horsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your horse looks so friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe you should let him\Ngo back to the stable. Okie Dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think she gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why do you have marks all over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect I'll treasure\Nthis for the rest of my life
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.52,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Dad"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was just about to come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Dad, let's do the thing! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doom da da da!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doom da da da!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Nita dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the Sanji for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's a wallflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.31,0:14:43.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,978)}{\fad(0,400)}Six Months Later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you're looking great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more year and you'll\Nbe in perfect health.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:15:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, once I get better,\Ncan I come visit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the sea pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to see it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,588)}Sorbet Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to live here again? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My disease will be all gone in a year!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were sad you'd get better before you\Nwere ten and it seems you were right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone in need of a babysitter again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All bad Conney!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.59,0:15:59.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1592,622)}Queen Dowager Conney, \NSorbet Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be happy to take\Ncare of Kuma, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful, you've all been too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate now, so if I stick around,\Nit might cause trouble for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll likely be over a year\Nuntil I can come back? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so long! How about\NI write you letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I pick you up, we'll take to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From there, it's an endless horizon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go all kinds\Nof places. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you anywhere you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only that were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in good hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.47,0:16:48.69,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,664)}Alpha, an Intelligence Agent \NCipher Pol No.8
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Per the doctor's orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be staying with Bonney until her\Ntreatment's done and she's all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day I'll check her temperature,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give her medicine, and\Nmonitor everything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nurse Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that in front of the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where Bonnie will be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this hospital doesn't\Nallow any suspicious visitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so make sure you always carry your IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One toe out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll snap her little neck.\NI know. I won't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye Bonnie and thank you\Nthank you for being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thus the tyrant became a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bartholomew kuma was obedient to his\Norders from the world government.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.71,0:18:38.51,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Seven Warlords of the Sea"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it made him a force to be reckoned\Nwith for pirates across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,young master it says here\Nthere's a new warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma the Tyrant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seas are full of villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's one more, I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you interested in the new warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, did you eliminate the\Nrat who saw our rainmaking ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flawlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say he's as tall as Whitebeard. So\Nwhich one of us do you think is stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, of course, Lady Alvida?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! They found a replacement already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from you, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who beat Hina Buddha and\Ncaused this mess in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does the new guy meet\Nyour lofty standards or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to figure that out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man's a former king?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose he won't be the\Nonly royalty in the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world of pirates\Ncertainly has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is of no concern to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not be going to\NCentral no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such ignorance ill suits\Nthe ruler of our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, sissy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says he has paw pad powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to be scared of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he wouldn't be a warlord\Nif he was weak, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the warlords work directly\Nunder the government, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the Kuma I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Bonnie, I'm riding\Nyou for my ship at sea.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.17,0:20:42.88,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Dad"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've become a bit infamous,\Nso it's harder to travel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's a bit far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to find all sorts of places that\Nyou and I can visit once you turn ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Koala, you have a\Nnew order from the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.44,0:22:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.

